        """Add multiple items in a line to control the format precisely.
        When add_comma is True, only accept actual values and
        ", " will be added between values automatically.

        :Example:

        >>> a = array()
        >>> a.add_line(1, 2, 3)
        >>> a.add_line(4, 5, 6)
        >>> a.add_line(indent="")
        >>> print(a.as_string())
        [
